      "content": "Hey, we have a massive problem. A memo just leaked about the candidate's vote against the community center funding bill last year. The press is already starting to ask questions and the local news is breathing down our necks. If this gets out that they just blocked the funding, our polling is gonna tank. I need a way to handle this. How do we spin this so it doesn't look like they were just anti-community center?",
